      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "队伍的大家都是因她的活跃而聚集于此，\n都憧憬着她，想和她一同奔跑下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c7b0d19c395b0f870004fb3762750340587f59f8a3560f04202dadfdc22a3ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
